{"4332490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Forbidden Forest", "steam_appid": 4332490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/4987bd7dd23d6767d132276f925b150b.avif?t=1786209833\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras_big/4987bd7dd23d6767d132276f925b150b.webp?t=1786209833 width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Looming high above Wildeland, a deadly threat emerges. A civilization glows brighter than the sun, destroying all in its path, the Hive. Who could rise to challenge this enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/d5b1a67cc33b1dc58d7746de61b5178f.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1546 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Forbidden Forest is a pixel-art <strong>metroidvania</strong> videogame, set in a vibrant but mysterious world. Jump, swim, and climb through <strong>lush forests</strong>, <strong>deep oceans</strong>, and <strong>ruined cities</strong>, as you master <strong>unique abilities</strong>, battle <strong>dangerous enemies</strong>, and chart a <strong>sprawling interconnected world</strong>. Meet powerful allies and fierce adversaries as you uncover the world’s deepest mysteries. Who is this <strong>Cub</strong>? Who are the <strong>bees</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why does a <strong>world's fate</strong> rest on a <strong>child's shoulders</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/8ca1c74b7d5b20ba11a40b9a1f8e14b0.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1020 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chart a huge metroidvania landscape, with over <strong>25 unique areas</strong> to explore, over <strong>30 unique badges</strong> to equip, and over <strong>40 challenging and engaging bosses</strong> to vanquish. Meet unique characters and learn the mysteries of a world on the edge of collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Metroidvania non-linear exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tight controls and quick, snappy movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 playable characters, with unique moves, powers, and encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 15 powerful abilities to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 30 badges to enhance combat and traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dozens of creatures and characters to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 40 gripping boss battle encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">1 special cub to save a dying land</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a <strong>lively, upbeat score</strong>, and <strong>expressive animation</strong>, The Forbidden Forest delivers an impactful adventure with a deep and powerful story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.poster.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.webm?t=1786209833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.mp4?t=1786209833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/4987bd7dd23d6767d132276f925b150b.avif?t=1786209833\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras_big/4987bd7dd23d6767d132276f925b150b.webp?t=1786209833 width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Looming high above Wildeland, a deadly threat emerges. A civilization glows brighter than the sun, destroying all in its path, the Hive. Who could rise to challenge this enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/d5b1a67cc33b1dc58d7746de61b5178f.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1546 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Forbidden Forest is a pixel-art <strong>metroidvania</strong> videogame, set in a vibrant but mysterious world. Jump, swim, and climb through <strong>lush forests</strong>, <strong>deep oceans</strong>, and <strong>ruined cities</strong>, as you master <strong>unique abilities</strong>, battle <strong>dangerous enemies</strong>, and chart a <strong>sprawling interconnected world</strong>. Meet powerful allies and fierce adversaries as you uncover the world’s deepest mysteries. Who is this <strong>Cub</strong>? Who are the <strong>bees</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why does a <strong>world's fate</strong> rest on a <strong>child's shoulders</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/8ca1c74b7d5b20ba11a40b9a1f8e14b0.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1020 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chart a huge metroidvania landscape, with over <strong>25 unique areas</strong> to explore, over <strong>30 unique badges</strong> to equip, and over <strong>40 challenging and engaging bosses</strong> to vanquish. Meet unique characters and learn the mysteries of a world on the edge of collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Metroidvania non-linear exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tight controls and quick, snappy movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 playable characters, with unique moves, powers, and encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 15 powerful abilities to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 30 badges to enhance combat and traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dozens of creatures and characters to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 40 gripping boss battle encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">1 special cub to save a dying land</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a <strong>lively, upbeat score</strong>, and <strong>expressive animation</strong>, The Forbidden Forest delivers an impactful adventure with a deep and powerful story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.poster.avif?t=1786209833\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.webm?t=1786209833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/extras/c66144ed308352b285c0bcf68717b1ed.mp4?t=1786209833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Jump, dash, and climb through a vibrant wilderness as three playable characters in this action-adventure metroidvania. Explore a sprawling interconnected map, master unique abilities, and face powerful foes, all while uncovering the mysteries of this war-stricken world and one special cub.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/d6e2369f1bf5e4400e4bcda5dd58cab25f6dd4ab/header.jpg?t=1786209833", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332490/4351d28b606acc50267d7b658c3a9586b900824f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17862